{
  "category": "Bonsai Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It looks as if it is always crying. It is actually adjusting its body’s fluid levels by eliminating excess.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It prefers arid environments. It leaks water from its eyes to adjust its body’s fluid levels.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "In order to adjust the level of fluids in its body, it exudes water from its eyes. This makes it appear to be crying.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "In order to adjust the level of fluids in its body, it exudes water from its eyes. This makes it appear to be crying.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It prefers arid environments. It leaks water from its eyes to adjust its body’s fluid levels.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "It prefers arid environments. It leaks water from its eyes to adjust its body’s fluid levels.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It does not deal well with water, so it lives in dry locales. Since its surroundings tend to lack greenery, it stands out noticeably.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "From its eyes, it can expel excess moisture from its body. This liquid is similar in composition to human sweat.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It discharges moisture from its eyes, making it look like it’s crying—apparently an effective way of getting enemies to let down their guard.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "If its body gets too damp, it will die. So, in a process reminiscent of sweating, its eyes expel moisture.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It expels both sweat and tears from its eyes. The sweat is a little salty, while the tears have a slight bitterness.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon lives in dry, rocky areas. As its green spheres dry out, their dull luster increases.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its tears elicit sympathy from those who see them, but do not be deceived! This expulsion of body water is merely a physiological mechanism for keeping itself in good health.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
